@startuml UC13_Change_Authentication_Details_Activity_Diagram

title UC13: Change Authentication Details - Activity Diagram

start
:User selects "Account Settings" option;

if (Authentication Service available?) then (no)
  :Frontend displays error and allows retry later;
  note right: Exception E1 - Authentication Service unavailable
  stop
endif

:Frontend displays editable username, email,
and password fields, pre-filled from the
current Firebase user object;
:User updates one or more fields and confirms;
:Frontend calls the corresponding Firebase
Client SDK method (updateProfile, updateEmail,
updatePassword) directly against
Authentication Service;

if (Session recent enough?) then (no)
  :Frontend prompts user to re-enter password;
  :Frontend calls SDK's re-authentication method;
  note right: Alternative Flow A1 - Re-authentication Required
  :Frontend retries the change;
endif

:Authentication Service validates
and applies the change;
:Frontend displays confirmation message;
stop

@enduml
